<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Höllentalklamm–Höllentalangerhütte with optional Stangensteig return — P2–Höllentalklamm–Höllentalangerhütte–Stangensteig loop</name><desc>From P2 at Hammersbach, use Hammersbacher Fußweg and the public village streets to Brandweg. Follow Brandweg and Dr. Heinrich Weg to the gorge, continue through its tunnels and galleries to Höllentalangerhütte, then retrace to the upper gorge junction and return across Eiserne Brücke on Stangensteig. Descend by Dr. Heinrich Weg and Brandweg to the same P2.

